Keys · Tools ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Tools
  h, left                move
  l, right               move
  space                  on/off
  enter                  actions
  i                      import every skill found outside agent-net
  d                      details
  m                      the all-tools list, for MCP servers
  R                      scan this machine's skills and MCP servers again
  n                      add

 Global keys
  1-7                    switch tabs: Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages, Tools, Settings, Inbox
  enter                  go into the selected thing
  arrows, j/k            move
  esc                    back; first clears a filter you typed
  /                      filter or search
  R                      refresh
  c                      open the CTO session
  C                      focus the CTO box
  ?                      help
  q, ctrl+c              quit
















up/down scroll  ? all screens  esc close
